  "security_implications": "This chunk loads secret key shares (key_share0) into sw_key_data_reg[0]. Partial updating of the key register when not all qe bits are set could expose an intermediate key value. The register is only cleared on reset, potentially leaving key material in silicon after use, which violates zeroization best practices. Parameter MaxKeyLen must be a multiple of 32 to ensure full key coverage; misconfiguration could lead to partial key loads. All of these factors risk key leakage, tampering, or weak cryptographic operation.",
